<title>GERMANY: Holzmann Q1 sales up, orders down.</title>
<headline>Holzmann Q1 sales up, orders down.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997 (in billions of marks)</p>
<p>    Group sales				2.7	 vs 2.4</p>
<p>    Group new business		     2.7	 vs 3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German building group is Philipp Holzmann AG.</p>
<p>Commenting on the business outlook, the company said in a statement: &quot;For the year 1997 as a whole Philipp Holzmann sees sales and orders in the same region as the year before. The operating profit will significantly improve... below the line (net profit) the group is seeking once again to break even.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
